   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Making an action negative",
     "texto": [
      "To make the present continuous negative, insert **-m-** before **-(I)yor**: **çalışıyorum** (I work/study) → **çalışmıyorum** (I don't work/study).",
      "**Bugün** means «today». **Her gün** means «every day».",
      "In yes/no questions, the particle **mi/mı/mu/mü** is written separately and takes the personal ending: **Çalışıyor musun?** = are you working?"
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
